IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WASM-CRYPTO-FONT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 WASM-RESULT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CRYPTO-HASH-LEN     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FONT-CURVES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PLATFORM-SCORE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-WASM-CRYPTO-FONT.
    IF WASM-RESULT == 0
        GO TO PLATFORM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF CRYPTO-HASH-LEN == 0
        GO TO PLATFORM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF FONT-CURVES == 0
        GO TO PLATFORM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO PLATFORM-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 WASM-RESULT.
    WEIGHT 30 CRYPTO-HASH-LEN.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

PLATFORM-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO PLATFORM-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
